{"id":"en_my-death-drove-my-brothers-mad","title":"My Death Drove My Brothers Mad","titleEn":"My Death Drove My Brothers Mad","description":"Catherine's three influential brothers—an heir to a business empire, a top medical examiner, and a professional hockey player—reserve all their affection for Nadia, a woman posing as an heiress, while shutting Catherine out. The source synopsis ends there, leaving the rest of the story untold. What follows presumably traces the consequences of that favoritism and the revelation of Nadia's deception. For viewers who want to see how this family drama unfolds, the series can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-death-drove-my-brothers-mad/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-death-drove-my-brothers-mad/en_US/535fc5f87e108994/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dp3f6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-death-drove-my-brothers-mad_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dp3f6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-death-drove-my-brothers-mad_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dp3f6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-death-drove-my-brothers-mad_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dp3f6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-death-drove-my-brothers-mad_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dp3f6/?pub=4occak","